    <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top: 40px;">Calibration blend</h2>
    <p>To properly calibrate the NGC for Landfill Applications, a special calibration blend is required. This blend can be ordered from Totalflow or custom blended per our requirements by your vendor.</p>
    <p>Custom calibration blends are acceptable, however, our recommended blend has the necessary components to support manual Peak Find. Custom blends that do not have the key components will not support factory settings for manual peak find without special procedures to identify the peaks for the missing components.</p>
